    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27849" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόκημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vision, fancy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὀνείρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					111
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ σοκήμασιν σοφά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					411
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκήματα</span>
			<i>make-believes,</i> of adopted sons, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				359
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>opinion, expectation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκημάτων ἐκτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HF</u>
					771
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόγμα, δ. τοῦ συνεδρίου</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).1259.3
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cimolus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				91.27
			</span></i> (Argos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
